DESCRIPTION:Sharing Time\, Talent\, and Treasure\n\nWhy Should I Give?\nBy
  giving together\, we can forge purposeful partnerships with organization
 s for the greatest positive impact to improve quality of life in the regi
 on. Let's unite as a Duke family to support the communities in which we w
 ork and live.\n\nWho Benefits?\nSchools\, nonprofits\, and neighborhoods 
 in Durham and throughout the region.\n\nGiving Categories\nDuke employees
  can contribute to one or more of these categories:\n- Community and Nonp
 rofit Support\n- Economic Mobility\, College Access\, and Career Readines
 s\n- Education\, Early Childhood\, and School Readiness\n- Health\, Nutri
 tion\, and Food Security\n- Neighborhoods\, Housing\, and Infrastructure\
 n- United Way of the Greater Triangle
