DESCRIPTION:Duke Rides is Duke's new signature indoor cycling fundraiser\,
  bringing Duke Nation together to support breakthrough cancer research\, 
 clinical trials\, and patient care. \n\nJoin us Oct. 3\, 2026\, at Wilson
  Recreation Center (Duke West Campus) for a high-energy\, four-hour exper
 ience featuring music\, inspiring stories\, and moments that highlight th
 e impact of cancer care and research. All fitness levels are welcome. Rid
 e or cheer from the sidelines - every effort makes a difference!\n\nLearn
  more and create a team at dukerides.org.
DURATION:PT5H
