DESCRIPTION:Celebrate 100 years of the Duke Symphony Orchestra with this s
 pecial centennial concert honoring a century of music-making at Duke!\n\n
 For this milestone performance\, DSO alumni return to the stage to perfor
 m alongside the current orchestra\, bringing generations of Duke musician
 s together for an unforgettable evening of music\, memories\, and communi
 ty.\n\nJoin us as we celebrate the Duke Symphony Orchestra's remarkable h
 istory\, vibrant present\, and exciting next century.\n\nThis event is fr
 ee and open to the public. All are welcome.\n\nInterested in supporting t
 he Duke Symphony Orchestra? To make a gift\, click the link on the right 
 side of the screen and search for "Duke Symphony Orchestra Fund." Your ge
 nerosity helps support the ensemble and its continued music-making at Duk
 e.
