DESCRIPTION:The Pachter Lab focuses on the development of single-cell geno
 mics technologies and their application to RNA biology. The computational
  challenges we are addressing involve the analysis of high-dimensional da
 ta. Theorems are sometimes proven\, experiments are occasionally successf
 ul\, and software is distributed on GitHub.
