CREATED:20260714T172407Z
DESCRIPTION:Experience chamber music up close as students from the Duke Ch
 amber Music Program receive coaching from the acclaimed musicians of Came
 rata Nordica.\n\nKnown for its dynamic\, almost theatrical approach to pe
 rformance\, the self-conducted octet plays standing in a semicircle\, cre
 ating an engaging and highly collaborative musical experience. ClassicsTo
 day.com has praised the ensemble as being "in a class by itself" for the 
 precision and artistry with which its musicians navigate even the most in
 tricate and demanding passages.\n\nThis special coaching session offers a
  rare opportunity to see emerging Duke musicians learn\, collaborate\, an
 d refine their craft alongside an extraordinary international ensemble.\n
 \nThis event is free and open to the public. All are welcome.
DURATION:PT1H30M
DTSTAMP:20260715T164725Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261005T170000
LAST-MODIFIED:20260715T164725Z
